# fixtures/i123-keys -- the REAL Lotus 1-2-3 Release 2.2 driven under DOSBox-X
# 2024.03.01 (bead initech-69mz, B11: EDIT / GOTO / PGDN / TAB ground truth).
# Driver: ../lotus123-decomp/tools/mint_drive.sh (lotus123-decomp 5ec1459),
# config = its mint/smoke_ref.conf with C: mounted on a scratch COPY of
# mint/work_ref (123.EXE md5 7f46c7eccab7c9ecb42e69a29fb16a9e); nothing saved.
# Each "shot NAME" is NAME.png beside this file (720x400, the 25-line screen:
# 20 worksheet rows, 8 columns of width 9). Captured 2026-10-20 by the
# i123keys lane; the date/time on the status line is the host clock.
# keys4 saves C:\T240.WK1 (copied here as T240.WK1): the label after F2 + Enter.
sleep 8
key Escape
type abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdef
sleep 1
shot 70_typed240
key Return
sleep 1
shot 71_stored240
key F2
sleep 1
shot 72_f2_240
type Q
sleep 0.5
shot 73_f2_240_typeq
key Return
sleep 1
shot 74_f2_240_enter
type /fs
sleep 1
type T240
key Return
sleep 2
shot 75_saved
end
